 (e.g., weather changes or attraction closures).  \n6. **Satisfaction:** The user expresses contentment with the itinerary’s quality, relevance, and alignment with their expectations.  \n\nBy maintaining these elements, the delegation brief ensures the user receives a practical, well-crafted itinerary optimized for their trip to New York City."}], 'author_name': 'DevUI-Requirements-Agent', 'additional_properties': {}}
